{"source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "hash": "46d2d94d4218066c3ad9da0d58b8114ca35030522eacf076daca97279d79e903", "nodes": [{"id": "document_80f3077207e3", "label": "2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_ced3c972bb56", "label": "Cluster-K concept (user canon): the clustering's curve of best fit decides the per-query evidence count K; the caller's k is only the ceiling", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_c5c557ee5a97", "label": "Facet verdict: stored HAS_TAG w_facets are non-signal — weights confined to 0.5–1.0, temporal on 555/20k edges; feeding query facet direction into them (detE) changed 5/100 retrieved sets, recall Δ 0.0000", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_92991f9c066c", "label": "Geometric det facet channel (HERB_DET_FACETS support/routing/edges) moved recall ≤ +0.003 at k=50 — facet placement, not facet values, is the open question", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_b36367b275f5", "label": "Value-knee cut rejected by measurement: per-question K equivalent to a flat cut at the same mean depth (0.6368 vs flat-37 0.6397); its break tracks the tag/desc-floor seam, a pool-composition artifact", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_deaf7ce2cf29", "label": "Curve walk (flag HERB_CURVE_K=1): parts widen to their area's edge (_height_edge on merge heights), description doors cut at their similarity break (_curve_k), the whole-need description embedding restored as its own door", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_2d4d6156938d", "label": "Curve-walk gold-100 result: recall_id 0.7005 / precision_id 0.0545 vs flat baseline 0.6972 / 0.0518 — first variant beating baseline on both; kept hit the 50-ceiling on all 100 questions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_dd69f269ebd8", "label": "Stated scope floods membership: 338 chunks mean (median 150.5, max 2742) per gold question; the semantic paths' natural K ≈ 30 (anchor 1.6 + widened 15.4 + desc 15.1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_c4682e78f76e", "label": "User judgment: the walk and the straight-fit break rule are not helping each other — edges precomputed before opening, no cross-part comparison, chord endpoint-relative where a cluster boundary is local", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_f990f9697a90", "label": "Open proposal awaiting the user's verdict: one global frontier across all doors on the shared cosine-distance scale; the stop read from the walk's own opened-height trajectory; K = where the walk stopped", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_7a710b02e3b3", "label": "Open decision: does stated scope count toward K, or corroborate and rank only", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_a150eddc04d9", "label": "HERB_CURVE_K naming flagged by the user (reads as forcing K=1; it is a boolean); rename to HERB_CURVE_WALK=1 or kill the flag — choice pending", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_33cf890076f0", "label": "_curve_k: break in a descending curve — unit square, head-to-tail straight fit, cut at the point furthest below it, 1e-9 noise guard, no dip means keep everything", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_fe30f56adc91", "label": "_height_edge: two-sided edge rule — shallow-then-jump keeps through the last shallow merge; jump-then-plateau is an isolated anchor and closes at the anchor; steady climb opens whole", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_604a847ccf73", "label": "Substitution failure (do not repeat): the value knee was built instead of the discussed height walk because it was less invasive; the user's concepts are the spec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_e3c773c84a7c", "label": "Ops: run.py finishes but never exits under redirected stdin (press-q abort watcher) — poll the out dir; use --no-eval for retrieval A/Bs; id metrics computable from arm_outputs.jsonl + questions.jsonl", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_dd79cf1d002a", "label": "Literature anchors: PM-2 proportional slot allocation (SIGIR 2012) for multi-frontier budgets; seed-weighted PPR + sweep cut (HippoRAG) formalizes query-relative areas; no published validation of LLM-emitted per-edge numeric weights", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_e360e10d6c79", "label": "Open review items: curve flag absent from run manifests (resume can mix regimes), det-leg contract contradiction, truncate_k invalid on curve-cut runs, sufficiency review silently skipped when the curve keeps fewer than 8", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"id": "concept_8932a8f0c4c7", "label": "Measurement debts: haiku leg untested on the current build; k=5/10/20 need real runs; the detW2 gain bundles three membership changes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\docs\\state\\2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}], "edges": [{"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_ced3c972bb56", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_c5c557ee5a97", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_92991f9c066c", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_b36367b275f5", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_deaf7ce2cf29", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_2d4d6156938d", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_dd69f269ebd8", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_c4682e78f76e", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_f990f9697a90", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source": "document_80f3077207e3", "target": "concept_7a710b02e3b3", "relation": "contains", "source_file": "state/2026-07-22-v1-curve-walk-facets-and-cluster-k.md"}, {"source